  "corrections": "The earlier PyBullet port had incorrect reconstruction of tangential contact forces for swapped body pairs and per-link friction writes that were redirected to the pelvis when combined with base damping and collision margin updates. V2 corrects both. Both comparison arms use the same fixed corrected port.",
  "relation_to_pr206": "This standalone physical transfer study uses corrected PyBullet, an independent 1,000-start fixed roster and a standalone scorer. PR #206 runs 16 fresh native MuJoCo starts (eight per shape) and applies a same-tick observation-response reward gate. These results do not supply an ALE normalized score.",
