    "ALE_feedback": "A submitted controller must change its first 64 body codes in response to altered observations at the same tick with duplicate-query changes controlled. The clock actor emits the same indexed planned body and finger row for any current post-reset observation. The low-level proprioceptive decoder feedback remains live. This physical panel did not run official ALE probes and earns no claimed ALE reward.",
    "uncertainty": "Per-arm 95% Wilson intervals use starts. Paired 95% percentile intervals use 10,000 bootstrap resamples of seed IDs, retaining both shapes."
